<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THIS COMMENT MUST STAY INSIDE THE ROOT <Flow> ELEMENT. A comment placed ABOVE <Flow>
        breaks `sf` deploy at source conversion with a misleading "unable to find matching parent
        xml file" error.

        PAUSED (Draft) 2026-08-18 - deliberate, reversible, logic unchanged. Reason: a new
        before-save flow, force-app/main/default/flows/LOI_Signed_Status_Sync.flow-meta.xml, now
        sets LOI_Signed__c = true automatically the moment an Acquisition LOI's Stage__c reaches
        'Signed' via the ordinary Advance Stage button / Path. This flow triggers on exactly that
        field (LOI_Signed__c EqualTo true, CreateAndUpdate), so left active it would start firing
        Notify_Legal / Notify_IR - Legal_Team and Investor_Relations GroupNotifier calls -
        automatically on every routine stage advance, which was explicitly not wanted (2026-08-18
        design decision D3). Nothing in this flow's own logic changed; only its activation state.

        <status> below is set to Draft, and the paired FlowDefinition
        (force-app/main/default/flowDefinitions/LOI_Signed_Notify.flowDefinition-meta.xml) has had
        its <activeVersionNumber> removed - that FlowDefinition change is the one that actually
        deactivates an already-active flow in the target org; the Draft status here keeps this file
        internally consistent with that fact for anyone who reads only this file.

        TO REACTIVATE: set <status> back to Active here AND restore <activeVersionNumber> in the
        paired FlowDefinition - re-review the reason above first, since reactivating without further
        change resumes the automatic Legal/IR notifications this pause exists to prevent.
    -->
    <actionCalls>
        <name>Notify_IR</name>
        <label>Notify IR</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>408</locationY>
        <actionName>GroupNotifier</actionName>
        <actionType>apex</actionType>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>recipientGroup</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Investor_Relations</stringValue>
